  "prefLabel": "Sw 703.01 Quarterly Incentive",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-06-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 703.01 Quarterly Incentive. Quarterly incentives shall be awarded as follows:\n\n(a) A sales rep whose quarterly instant ticket sales exceed the same quarter from the prior fiscal year, by the established sales goal or greater, shall receive $1000.00;\n\n(b) A sales rep whose quarterly instant ticket sales exceed the same quarter from the prior fiscal year’s sales, by the sales goal and an additional 60% or greater, shall receive $2000.00; and\n\n(c) A sales rep shall be eligible to receive 4 quarterly incentives per fiscal year.\n\nSource. #10035, INTERIM, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRES: 6-29-12; ss by #10132, eff 5-23-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw700.html"
